- Suggested word-forms that drop a counted digit ("שנה אחת", "קול אחד", "ממוצע שלוש השנים", the link label with no 10) fail checkNumbers. Hebrew number-words are not in the checker lexicon. The prose was naturalized and the digit kept in parentheses. Noted here rather than left as "1 שנה אחרונה".
- he-a 44, delete the table row קושי ההליך. Deleting a row changes the table-row count. The three cells were rephrased so they state a narrower or stricter statutory threshold and "אין תוצאה מובטחת", and the row remains.
